removed:
- forwarding N1.5: a body of 1 MiB with 413 on the answering side, 1 MiB of an answer, «Wait» of a row, `answer too large`, `answer broke
  off` — the stand sends no bodies and answers larger than a MiB, does not hold the console longer than the deadline, and there is no teaching door with a large or broken-off
  answer; the recognition of `X-Operator: console` by role (only at the role door of the domain console, P/10-10) — the stand is without TLS; the journal `domain.forwarded`, `access.break_glass.*`,
  `domain.shared.refused` — acceptance does not compare the journal;
- the TLS client of the console (N1.7) — the stand does not raise TLS between clusters on one machine ([TLS stand](../../common/acceptance/tls/README.md));
- the break-glass entry: the session deadline `GLASS_SESSION` — a step longer than `GLASS_SESSION`; `GLASS_SESSIONS_MAX`; the equal answer time and
  the lane by the peer's address;
- forwarding to the signer: 400 `one hop`, 413, 502 of the signer, the deadlines 10/90 s — the stand does not call them;
- `GET /api/backup`: 403 and 401 by the word of `ask-sig`, 503, the answer 200 with a backup — at the keeper's console on the stand of chapter 8.8
  (sc. 10 step 15, the signature of the process `domain` of the target) and the vectors [`ask-sig`](../../common/vectors/ask-sig/README.md) (judge-only: acceptance details);
- `?unit=` of another manifest — 404 `no such unit` (the catalogue of the stand is one manifest); an invalid Bearer at `/api/held` and
  the value at read time at the holder — the object that the pointer names — sc. 16.

The implementation must name in its description:

1. **the command `resolve`** — a template with `{input}` by which the implementation passes the vectors `resolve` (the command `alarms` — lesson P/10);
2. **how the runner passes the environment** to the consoles and the process `domain` of the stand (`CLUSTERS`, `DOMAIN_CONSOLE_URL`) and how it
   restarts the console and the agent of a cluster with a variable (`@env` of «Domain stand» of the common README of acceptance);
3. **the TLS client of the cluster console**: the library for chain verification, as long as the order and the words of the function `peer` are kept (the agent's client — [P/09.1](../../09-agent/spec/09.1-agent.norms.md) «Implementation decides» item 8).

Реализация обязана назвать в своём описании:

1. **команду `resolve`** — шаблон с `{input}`, которым реализация проходит векторы `resolve` (команда `alarms` — урок P/10);
2. **как раннер передаёт окружение** консолям и процессу `domain` стенда (`CLUSTERS`, `DOMAIN_CONSOLE_URL`) и как
   перезапускает консоль и агента кластера с переменной (`@env` «Стенда домена» общего README приёмки);
3. **клиент TLS консоли кластера**: библиотека проверки цепочки, лишь бы порядок и слова функции `peer` сохранялись (клиент агента — [P/09.1](../../../09-agent/ru/spec/09.1-agent.norms.md) «Решает реализация» п. 8).
